observation_cut {completed,frontier,uncompleted};
claim_availability [{formal_object,status:"instantiated"|"declared-model"|"unavailable",reason,evidence_ids}].
Optional exact extensions carry rational clock passages, logical/physical oscillator, pantographic Q^n links, proper time, resource balance, and route permutations.

Cross-apparatus receiver agreement is validated only when CPU and GPU artifacts reference the identical semantic_body_sha256 and every compared micro event projects to the same semantic ID with matching receiver value. Compare exact work vectors and returned causal morphology separately from elapsed time; neither worker count nor nanoseconds establishes semantic independence.

